[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1659152763","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2056#issuecomment-1659152763","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2056","id":1659152763,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85i5Kl7","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-07-31T20:59:10Z","updated_at":"2023-07-31T20:59:10Z","body":"To clarify something for those who didn't read the Fedora issue, the project has no license text other than:\r\n```\r\nThe python-ldap package is distributed under Python-style license.\r\n\r\nStandard disclaimer:\r\n   This software is made available by the author(s) to the public for free\r\n   and \"as is\".  All users of this free software are solely and entirely\r\n   responsible for their own choice and use of this software for their\r\n   own purposes.  By using this software, each user agrees that the\r\n   author(s) shall not be liable for damages of any kind in relation to\r\n   its use or performance. The author(s) do not warrant that this software\r\n   is fit for any purpose.\r\n```\r\nAnd the project separately says:\r\n> The current maintainers assume that the license is the sentence that refers to \"Python-style license\" and assume this means a highly permissive open source license that only requires preservation of the text of the LICENCE file (including the disclaimer paragraph).\r\n\r\nI.e. the current maintainers at least don't seem to interpret \"Python-style\" as a \"same as Python\" sort of licensing shorthand.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1659152763/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1659432721","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2056#issuecomment-1659432721","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2056","id":1659432721,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85i6O8R","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/use