 which are applied based on time when the code was accepted or based on approval of original author - so in the end, python-ldap has parts which are under MIT license (which are newer contributions or original contributors approved the license change), and some parts which are under the reported license above. But the ldif.py file stays under this old license, which I wasn't able to find license identifier for.\r\n\r\nThe hplip project itself (the project which is in Fedora and has ldif.py in its sources) uses several licenses as well, if it matters.\r\n\r\nSince the license comes originally from python-ldap, I wouldn't call it HPLIP - especially if there are several other licenses in the project already.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1659643233/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1660458728","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2056#issuecomment-1660458728","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2056","id":1660458728,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85i-Jbo","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.