//api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-08T05:03:44Z","updated_at":"2023-09-08T05:03:44Z","body":"I think what they're saying is, they assume that the original licensors didn't intend \"Python-style license\" to mean \"the actual PSF-2.0 [or Python-2.0.1, etc.] license, with implied licensor name substitutions\". Rather, they are assuming the original licensors had a more vague idea in their heads of having a conventional (for the times) permissive license policy. I think that's a reasonable interpretation under the circumstances. \r\n\r\nAnyway, I'm not sure it matters for SPDX license inclusion purposes? \r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1711079153/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1738364475","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2056#issuecomment-1738364475","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2056","id":1738364475,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85nnVY7","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-28T02:55:26Z","updated_at":"2023-09-28T03:17:50Z","body":"# License Inclusion Decision\r\n\r\n## Decision:\r\n\r\n- [x] approved\r\n- [ ] not approved\r\n\r\n## Name\r\n\r\nPython ldap License\r\n\r\n## License ID\r\n\r\npython-ldap\r\n\r\n## XML markup\r\n\r\nnone\r\n\r\n## Notes:\r\n\r\nnone\r\n\r\n## Additional rationale or notes on decision:\r\n\r\none question on name and id is LDAP usually capitalized? @richardfontana - do you know? <answered below, updated above>\r\n\r\n## Next steps ##\r\nIf the license has been accepted, please follow [the accepted-license process to create the PR](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/main/DOCS/request-new-license.md#accepted-license-process). ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1738364475/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1738375244","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2056#issuecomment-1738375244","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2056","id":1738375244,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85nnYBM","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-28T03:14:57Z","updated_at":"2023-09-28T03:14:57Z","body":"@jlovejoy LDAP is usually capitalized when referred to as a protocol, but in this case, the reference is to a project known as \"python-ldap\", not \"python-LDAP\": \r\nhttps://www.python-ldap.org/en/python-ldap-3.4.3/  \r\nhttps://pypi.org/project/python-ldap/  \r\nhttps://github.com/python-ldap/python-ldap \r\nTherefore the identifier should be `python-ldap`. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1738375244/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]